  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "We use the BODMAS rule to solve the equation:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/8be3f7bb8bcabfadc89f04abb4cdcb05c19fc7e10b2276dfa17cd6250ef9819d.png] \n\nThe given equation:\n\n64*4*3*71*19*5*43\n\nWe apply each option to the given equation:\n\nOption 1) -, +, ×, =, -, ×\n\n64 - 4 + **__3 × 71__** = 19 - __**5 × 43**\n\n**64**__ - 4 **__+ 213__** = 19 - 215\n\n**__277 - 4__** = **__19 - 215__** \n\n273 ≠ -196\n\n**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 2) +, =, ×, ÷, -, +\n\n64 + 4 = 3 × **__71 ÷ 19__** - 5 + 43\n\n64 + 4 = **__3 × 3.7__** - 5 + 43\n\n**__64 +__****__ 4__** = **__11.2__** - 5 **__+__****__ 43__**\n68 = **__54.2 - 5__**\n\n68 ≠ 49.2\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ×, +, =, -, ×, -\n\n**__64 × 4__** + 3 = 71 - **__19 × 5__** - 43\n\n**__256 + 3__** = 71 - 95 - 43\n259 = **__71 - 95 - 43__**\n259 ≠ - 67\nLHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 4) ÷, +, =, −, ×, +\n\n**__64 ÷____ 4__** + 3 = 71 - 19 × 5 + 43\n\n16 + 3 = 71 - **__19 × 5__** + 43\n**__16 + 3__** = **__71__** - 95 **__+ 43__**\n19 = **__114 - 95__**\n\n19 = 19\nLHS = RHS,\n\nHence **the correct answer is option 4)**",
